**The argument:** the draft makes a medium-confidence Type 9 case. It opens on a contrast. Abrams told an interviewer in 2019 that talking about himself felt "somewhat frightening." Seven years later, Brian Duffield, who directed Abrams's upcoming film *Whalefall*, said he often had to tell him "you cannot do this because you'll die." The Type 9 case rests on a pattern that runs from 2017 to 2026. He says yes because of the people involved (Ben Stiller, then Clooney and Pitt, then Zach Cregger), he stayed with *Weapons* through a full recast, and when asked about himself he stresses how alike people are. Type 4 is the main alternative and gets its own section. That section also says what evidence would move the call to 4. Types 6 and 3 are covered after it, and a final section lists what no type explains well.

